This license covers the tools and translation data in this repository. It
does not and cannot cover Reco Love Gold Beach itself, which is the property
of its original publisher/developer -- see README.md.

tools/lib/sceutils/ is a separate MIT-licensed project (TeamMolecule's
sceutils, (c) 2018 molecule); its own LICENSE file is kept alongside it.
EXCEPT tools/lib/sceutils/keys.py: that file is not from upstream sceutils
(which deliberately excludes it via its own .gitignore) -- it was regenerated
from the GPLv2-licensed Vita3K project instead, which doesn't cleanly fit the
MIT license of the folder it sits in. See the "A note on
tools/lib/sceutils/keys.py" section of README.md before assuming this
folder's blanket MIT statement covers that one file.

tools/bin/vita-make-fself.exe, libvita-export.dll, libvita-import.dll and
libvita-yaml.dll are built from the MIT-licensed VitaSDK project.
libwinpthread-1.dll is the MinGW-w64 runtime's winpthreads library, not
VitaSDK.
